{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cWhen you look into A Bit of Tales, A Bit of Tales also looks into you.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elyssa, Goddess of Dimension (She doesn't exist in your world.)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568300/extras/SteamGIF_4.gif?t=1743824970\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In a Bit of Tales</strong>\u00a0is a one-of-a-kind horror anthology game featuring 7 spine-chilling stories, delivered in an omakase-style experience. Explore haunting dreams, mysterious cults, ghostly schools, and more. Each tale is thoughtfully crafted to give a distinct and memorable horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568300/extras/SteamGIF_2.gif?t=1743824970\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover 7 unique and chilling horror tales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the &quot;Protagonist&quot; and shape the outcome of each story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience varied presentations, graphics, and gameplay styles for every story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The average length of each &quot;Bit&quot; is 5-30 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568300/extras/SteamGIF_1.gif?t=1743824970\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore &quot;Bits&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maria: </strong>Face your nightmare\u2014chaotic and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metamorphosis: </strong>Do you remember what happened in the laboratory?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slime Swamp: </strong>Humanity\u2019s desires are endless\u2026 and she wishes to become a Slime Girl!?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Is It Truly Satan?: </strong>You are a devoted follower of The Satan, Cre\u2019ne.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shut Your Eyes:</strong> If you see it, it sees you. The restless spirits of this school are watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Butterfly's Lament: </strong>Take on the role of a loving boyfriend waiting for his beloved girlfriend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Old Photograph:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>A photograph that brings back memories of a tragic event\u2026?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568300/extras/SteamGIF_3.gif?t=1743824970\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Thank you so much in advance for all your support!, Daybloom Project</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568300?t=1743824970","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568300?t=1743824970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568300/38eecdd31183a533b40d3e97045fdeeb1887101c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743824970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568300/38eecdd31183a533b40d3e97045fdeeb1887101c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743824970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains sensitive content, including themes of suicide, blood a